tree Small text

box ledger as Ledger [note: empty]

step Add leaves
  say note adds small text under the box name.
  leaf tx1 [hash: 3fa0]
  leaf tx2 [hash: 8b04]

step Join
  say A note line inside a step rewrites that small text from that step on.
  node root of tx1, tx2 [hash: 7a21]
  note ledger: root 7a21
